        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Absalomu geajoar ak geabwar ghami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayiida Dawdi fuga mideawa, ak goombiit shirikareeda hees ambala fuga nyiit sagalamnyoojiga ea gea ambala bughalajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' Dawdi gaweay lugooda, nea nibwaash geenga ghoah samwagu, geahagi goombal shirikarajeanda haw siguura Yoabu, nea geedeaba iyeenya goombal shirikarajeanda haw siguura Abishayi was orjeeda Seruya, was orjeeda geenyea Yoabu, nea geedeaba samwagu ghwanung' goombal shirikarajeanda siguura Itayi bea eemeeda Giti. Ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda buuneeda, “Eara aniini gajeeteayeena sea agooga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda buuneeda ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i majuna. Aba gideaba iisimng'awji, ghanyea maygwaduupeasa saawa. Eara ealach bugusteanya eeteenyi ak gameewa meatkweanagi, ghanyea maygwaduupeasa saawa. Aba gideaba ang'iing'i ging'ali fih sagalamnyooji damanamughuush aba jeedeanya; ghang'wana abeeda ginung' eeweaya aseasa eaweada mujiini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha saawa, “Gidoadaayi gideaba ghwahit aba heedeang'wa gaydasin.” Hean ghamiinaada sugoocheanda aba murdeeda huwaneeda, nea ghang'ata lugooda nea gabadiina bughalajeega ea gea badiina sagalamnyoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarukusa sugoocheanda Yoabu ea Abishayi ea Itayi gideaba, “Asisiina ng'asheega miyaasiin Absalomu aba badaydeanyu.” Ak gwayiing'shi buuneesean damanda rukusiina sugoocheanda shirikareadaanyi sean hees iita Absalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay lugooda dareapcheeda gang'uchi sea Israeli; ak geeng'ucheesa dareabeeta Efraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geajoar fuga Israeli aba hoowa nea ghwajoar fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi, ak ghwasaang'ayiit muscheeka eaweedida, ak ghwahita fih sagalamnyooji diktam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaheedu ng'ucheeda ea gwadarsa badayda ng'eanyiisean; ak gwaduulu dareabeeta buuneeda ea ghwanaawa fuga asha aba ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu aba gheamamda gwaroonyi Absalomu sea fuga gadiyeeda Dawdi. Abeeda Absalomu gwading'da badayda nghataanyi, ak gawa nghata jeeda damealga hees bea geeta haw was sabiida, ak ghaghas gheata sabiida, ak geenung'wa heeda nea ghabwardaghaat ak ea maba humng'eeda nea maba ng'eanyi, nea ghabwaakghta nghata gwachi ding'da. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwadeagu siyagi, ak gwarukusa Yoabu gideaba, “Ng'ula, aniini ghaadaayi Absalomu nea ghabwardaghaat aba uhuuda sabiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yoabu ak gwayeesha siidida rukusa ng'asheandean gideaba, “Ang'iing'i, nidaahi ng'asheanji! Abeeda ghwasaan inyas milasi ea gawa ng'eanyi? Gwachi gaydahoosan ak geagoonyeey shiliingaji damanamughuush ea inyeashta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda siida ak gwayeesha Yoabu, “Eara gwachi goobissa geatindeanyu shiliingaji sagalama, maydeaheaksa geatindeanyu orjeeda sugoocheanda; aba gideaba geayiinyi nea gwarukuneey sugoocheanda ang'iing'i ea Abishayi ea Itayi gideaba, ‘Adiidu gisawani Absalomu aba badaydeanyu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuut gicha, iineasinyi ng'asheega munyas ak ghaabwarji (abeeda ea maygwanda gichea ea funyaat aba heeda sugoocheanda), ak gwachi ea mayweadaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yoabu ak gwayeesha, “Aniini mwammuusi deameas ak geabalooleey nea goosha aseeta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay fih damanamughuush was fuga sareeni dabita ng'ucheeda bea Yoabu, ak gwaneaweesa Absalomu ak ghang'ut, ak ghabwar ghami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaghuut Yoabu durumbeati, ak gabiikna lugooda eata geeshta fuga Israeli; aba gideaba ghoaghuum Yoabu buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanda saawa Absalomu, ak gwajaksa jeeda shoomanda haw aba jeeda dareabeeta, ak geemuguushsa badaydaanyi dulgwajeanda haw bea lagheanga; ak gamng'aw Israeleesean ak gaba siisi gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Absalomu damanda waseewa majeek ea nigeanu ak gamiindeaysa geaw daraneeda mida jeeda moangoachiyda sugoocheanda, nea gwayi, “Aniini meandeawani orjeeda jea gahuuw gheawungeasu ak ghwanung' eepkeadi”; ak gang'asa daraneedida gheawungaaschi, ak geeguura daraneeda Absalomu ea ghoah ghamneawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi geerukusa miyeeda Absalomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Ahimasi was orjeeda Sadoki, “Gaydafwach, ak ghaadawji sugoocheanda iita gidawaldeayda NG'UTAMIIDA mureandooda aba heeda weajoodigaaschi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Yoabu ak gwayeesha niny, “Ang'iing'i muwoosi siida jea ghwaat iita askweareani; gajaada iita eaweecha nuut, duuku askweareani ea mwajaada iita, aba gideaba orjeeda sugoocheanda nimi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yoabu siida Gushi, “Una, ak girukusi sugoocheanda gididaahi.” Ak ghwahiiy geaw siida Gushi aba madeeda Yoabu, ak ghafwach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta Ahimasi was orjeeda Sadoki ak gwayeesha Yoabu, “Meaduupi gichea ghwahidu wassean, nung'waada eara aniini dafwach damaseaw siida Gushi.” Hean gwayeesha Yoabu, “Ghwasaan inyas gayfwaja, orjeedeanyu, nea ghanyea manda gichea nyasa aba iidi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi, “Giduurji sean, gaydafwach.” Gwayeesha, “Asaha, fwaja.” Hean ghafwach Ahimasi nea gwasik naweeda mooheeda, ak ghwasuut siida Gushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Dawdi goopteada aba dageascheeda dooshinga assiyeenya; ak gwading'da furiischoocheanda uhuuda ghamarda ak ghamiinaada aba heetiyeada deaschi ghuuta dooshta, hean gagatkat gheanyangaaschi ak ghoang'wearda, ghwadaah siida fwach nea gabwageaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaguurda furiischoocheanda ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda. Ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda niny, “Iibwageaw, abeeda gwanda ghuutaanyi iita jea gwarugu.” Hean gafaju ak gwaneekiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwadaah furiischoocheanda siinuut nea gafaju; ak gaguursa furiischoocheanda dea fura dooshta ak gwayeesha, “Daaha, siinuut gafaja nea gabwageaw!” Gwayeesha sugoocheanda niny, “Eara niny gweadu iita.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi furiischoocheanda, “Iyeang'ulayi aniini siida gwachi bea madeeda fwach ghafwachta Ahimasi orjeeda Sadoki.” Ak gwayi sugoocheanda, “Niny siida miyi, ak gweadu iita miy.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguurda Ahimasi ak gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Ng'asheega sean ghwahit.” Ak gwatkuy aba madeeda sugoocheanda ea ghang'uda gheamamdaanyi ng'eanyi, ak gwayi, “Gagasa eebadiischeesa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ghayi adayda fuga aheaksa geatinga nyaawa ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak ghoanyaashta gideaba, “Orjeeda was Absalomu gaba seayu?” Ghwasha Ahimasi ak gwayeesha, “Damanda ajeakteawa Yoabu siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda, ghayiinyi nyeashta haw, ak ea mwaanali gidawas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha, “Yamwa geaw, ak gimiinaadi aba hiji.” Hean ghwayam geaw, ak ghamiinaada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
