              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'ula, deagheata ghwahidu siida Gushi; ak gwayi siida Gushi, “Geandeawi iita miy jea daadaw ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda! Aba gideaba niwalda NG'UTAMIIDA mureandooda askweareani aba uurjeenga buuneesean gasa gang'ucheeweey.” ",
          "type": "text",
