          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda sugoocheanda ak gwayeesha siida Gushi, “Orjeeda was Absalomu gaba seayu?” Ghwasha siida Gushi nea gwayeesha, “Gidabal weajoodiga ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, sea fuga sean gasa gang'ucheeweey, gawuurji orjeedida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
