              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadeawiit muuchi, ak gawa jeeda ghooriida mida heetiyeada was ghuuta dooshta, ak gooyeawda; nea damanda beawa, gwayi, “Ea orjeedeanyu Absalomu, orjeedeanyu, orjeedeanyu Absalomu! Anda gwachi mwameawi aba hoorgeadaang'u!”",
          "type": "text",
